      "cooked": "<p>Ok, it’s kind of a plug, but I’m not associated with the company in any way. Evil Hat has released their Kickstarter project for Race to Adventure, as of a couple days ago. It’s a competitive modular board game involving a race through various exciting locations. It’s set in their Spirit of the Century world, so pulp adventure to the max. Since superhero comics are an off-shoot of the pulp genre, it seems that I may not be the only here with similar interests.</p>\n<p>This is Evil Hat’s first foray into the board game market, after successfully doing RPGs (FATE system, Don’t Rest Your Head) and launching a fiction line. They’re definitely worth checking out.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/evilhat/race-to-adventure-a-spirit-of-the-centurytm-board\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Kickstarter</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/388;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7f076a2f3069bf13c6b50c1f281c56c9baeebc52_2_690x388.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7f076a2f3069bf13c6b50c1f281c56c9baeebc52_2_690x388.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7f076a2f3069bf13c6b50c1f281c56c9baeebc52_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7f076a2f3069bf13c6b50c1f281c56c9baeebc52_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7f076a2f3069bf13c6b50c1f281c56c9baeebc52_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/evilhat/race-to-adventure-a-spirit-of-the-centurytm-board\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Race to Adventure! A Spirit of the Century™ Board Game</a></h3>\n\n<p>Race to Adventure!™ is an easy-to-learn, pulp-themed family board game you can play in 20-30 minutes. Suitable for ages 8 &amp; up.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
